#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:1
msgid "Local accounts and the waiting list"
msgstr "本地账号与等候名单"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:3
msgid ""
"Cloud Agent can run with its own accounts instead of HybridInference "
"Gateway sign-in. Set `AGENT_AUTH_MODE=local` and people sign up with an "
"email address and a password, verify the address, sign in, and apply for "
"Agent use through a waiting list that administrators review. Gateway mode"
" remains the default, and nothing in this page changes it."
msgstr ""
"Cloud Agent 可以使用自己的账号体系，无需通过 HybridInference Gateway 登录。设置 "
"`AGENT_AUTH_MODE=local` 后，用户使用邮箱和密码注册、验证邮箱并登录，再通过等候名单申请使用 "
"Agent，由管理员审核。默认仍为网关模式，本文不会改变这一默认值。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:9
msgid ""
"The design is [independent accounts and waiting "
"list](../agents/specs/2026-10-27-independent-accounts-and-waitlist-design"
".zh-CN.md). This page describes what is implemented."
msgstr ""
"设计见[独立账号与 waiting list](../agents/specs/2026-10-27-independent-accounts-"
"and-waitlist-design.zh-CN.md)。本文说明已实现的功能。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:13
msgid "What local mode changes"
msgstr "本地模式改变了什么"

