#: ../developer/local-accounts.md ../developer/local-accounts.md:97
msgid "Identity and admission"
msgstr "身份与准入"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Gateway `agent-access` lookup"
msgstr "查询网关的 `agent-access`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "This database, read on every check, with no cache"
msgstr "每次检查都读取本服务的数据库，不缓存"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Profile and team emails"
msgstr "Profile 与团队邮箱"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Gateway user status"
msgstr "网关用户状态"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "The local account's email"
msgstr "本地账号的邮箱"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Administration"
msgstr "管理权限"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`ADMIN_TOKEN` or Gateway `agent.admin`"
msgstr "`ADMIN_TOKEN` 或网关的 `agent.admin`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`ADMIN_TOKEN` or a local account with `agent.admin`"
msgstr "`ADMIN_TOKEN` 或拥有 `agent.admin` 的本地账号"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Inference"
msgstr "推理"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Gateway grants and catalog"
msgstr "网关授权与模型目录"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"None: no Gateway grant is minted for a local account (see "
"[Models](#models))"
msgstr "不提供：不会为本地账号签发网关授权（见[模型](#models)）"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:24
msgid ""
"In local mode `app.state.gateway` is `LocalModeGateway` "
"(`cloud_agent/accounts/directory.py`). It has the methods the Gateway "
"client has. Identity and admission are answered from this database, and "
"each Gateway-only method is refused with a typed error, without a network"
" call. Every existing owner check therefore reads the local decision: "
"request admission, claims, goal rounds, waiting messages, team approval "
"and ownership transfer, the on-call service account, Profile and team "
"rosters. A local account ID never reaches the Gateway."
msgstr ""
"本地模式下，`app.state.gateway` 是 "
"`LocalModeGateway`（`cloud_agent/accounts/directory.py`）。它提供与网关客户端相同的方法。身份与准入从本服务的数据库读取；仅网关支持的方法直接返回带类型的错误，不发起网络请求。因此，所有现有的所有者检查都会读取本地准入决定，包括请求准入、认领、目标轮次、等待消息、团队审批与所有权转移、值班服务账号、Profile"
" 和团队成员名单。本地账号 ID 不会传到网关。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:33
msgid "Enabling it"
msgstr "启用本地模式"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:35
msgid ""
"Local mode needs its own database. At startup it binds an empty database "
"to local identity (`agent_local_identity_namespace`). It refuses a "
"database bound to a Gateway issuer, or one that holds owner data without "
"a binding. Gateway mode, in turn, refuses a database bound to local "
"identity. Both checks take the same table lock, so two listeners that "
"start in different modes cannot each bind the database. No setting skips "
"these checks. Moving an existing Gateway-bound database to local accounts"
" is a separate identity migration (phase A3 in the design), and it is not"
" implemented."
msgstr ""
"本地模式需要独立数据库。启动时会把空数据库绑定到本地身份（`agent_local_identity_namespace`）。数据库若已绑定网关签发方，或虽未绑定却已有所有者数据，启动就会被拒绝。反过来，网关模式也会拒绝已绑定本地身份的数据库。两项检查持有同一把表锁，所以两个监听器即使以不同模式同时启动，也不能分别绑定同一数据库。没有配置项可以跳过这些检查。把已绑定网关的数据库转为本地账号，需要单独实施身份迁移，即设计中的"
" A3 阶段，目前尚未实现。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_AUTH_MODE=local`"
msgstr "`AGENT_AUTH_MODE=local`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Selects local accounts. Set it on both listeners."
msgstr "选择本地账号模式。两个监听器都要设置。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"At least 32 random bytes, different from `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`. Keys the"
" stored hashes of sessions, emailed tokens and abuse counters."
msgstr "至少 32 个随机字节，且与 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` 不同。作为密钥，用于计算并存储会话、邮件令牌和防滥用计数器的哈希。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_ENABLED`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_ENABLED`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "On by default. Set `false` to close public sign-up."
msgstr "默认开启。设置为 `false` 可关闭公开注册。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_SMTP_*`"
msgstr "`AGENT_SMTP_*`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"The mail relay. Without a host and a sender, sign-up is closed and "
"recovery answers 503."
msgstr "邮件中继。未配置主机或发件人时，注册关闭，账号恢复请求返回 503。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`"
msgstr "`AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "The only base used for emailed links. A request's `Host` is never used."
msgstr "邮件链接只使用这个基地址，不使用请求中的 `Host`。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:52
msgid ""
"The web server must reach the same control plane "
"(`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_URL`). The web app reads `GET /v1/auth/config` to "
"choose its sign-in pages."
msgstr ""
"Web 服务器必须能访问同一控制平面（`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_URL`）。Web 应用读取 `GET "
"/v1/auth/config` 来选择登录页面。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:55
msgid "The first administrator"
msgstr "首位管理员"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:57
msgid ""
"No endpoint grants the first administrator, and the first account to sign"
" up gets nothing. Someone who holds the deployment's database credential "
"and local secret runs:"
msgstr "没有任何接口会授予首位管理员权限，首个注册账号也不会获得额外权限。持有本部署数据库凭据和本地密钥的人需要运行："

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:66
msgid ""
"The account must exist and must have verified its email. `--approve` also"
" approves its Agent application, because administration is granted only "
"to an approved account. Each step goes through the same audited, "
"versioned action the administration API uses, with the actor `deployment-"
"bootstrap`."
msgstr ""
"账号必须已经存在，并已验证邮箱。`--approve` 还会批准该账号的 Agent "
"使用申请，因为只有获批账号才能获得管理权限。每一步都使用与管理 API 相同的操作，执行版本校验并记录审计，操作者记为 `deployment-"
"bootstrap`。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:71
msgid "The HTTP surface"
msgstr "HTTP 接口"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:73
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Errors use the usual envelope, `{\"detail\": {\"error\": {\"type\", "
"\"message\"}}}`. Every response is `no-store`. A refused body is reported"
" by field and rule only, so a 422 never repeats a password or a token."
msgstr ""
"错误沿用现有格式：`{\"detail\": {\"error\": {\"type\", \"message\"}}}`。所有响应均为 `no-"
"store`。请求体校验失败时，只报告字段和规则，因此 422 响应不会回显密码或令牌。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Route"
msgstr "路由"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`GET /v1/auth/config`"
msgstr "`GET /v1/auth/config`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{mode, signup_enabled}`. Public, in both modes."
msgstr "`{mode, signup_enabled}`。两种模式下都公开可读。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`POST /v1/auth/signup`"
msgstr "`POST /v1/auth/signup`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{ok: true}` for every address. A registered address gets a password-"
"reset link, not a second account, and its password is not changed."
msgstr "对所有邮箱地址都返回 `{ok: true}`。已注册地址会收到密码重置链接，不会创建第二个账号，也不会修改原密码。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`POST /v1/auth/login`"
msgstr "`POST /v1/auth/login`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Sets the cookie and returns the session body. `invalid_credentials` for "
"an unknown email and for a wrong password alike. `email_not_verified` and"
" `account_suspended` only after the right password."
msgstr ""
"设置 cookie 并返回会话响应。邮箱不存在或密码错误都返回 `invalid_credentials`；只有密码正确时才会返回 "
"`email_not_verified` 或 `account_suspended`。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/auth/verify-email`, `/resend-verification`, `/forgot-password`,"
" `/reset-password`"
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/auth/verify-email`, `/resend-verification`, `/forgot-password`,"
" `/reset-password`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{ok: true}`. Tokens are single-use and expire (24 hours to verify, 1 "
"hour to reset); a newer token replaces older ones. A reset verifies the "
"email and ends every session of the account."
msgstr ""
"返回 `{ok: true}`。令牌只能使用一次，并有有效期：验证邮箱为 24 小时，重置密码为 1 "
"小时；新令牌替换旧令牌。重置密码也会验证邮箱，并结束该账号的所有会话。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`GET /v1/session/me`"
msgstr "`GET /v1/session/me`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Adds `auth_mode`, `email` and `waitlist` for a local account. The "
"Gateway-mode body is unchanged."
msgstr "为本地账号增加 `auth_mode`、`email` 和 `waitlist`。网关模式的响应体保持不变。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`POST /v1/session/logout`"
msgstr "`POST /v1/session/logout`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Revokes the local session, then clears the cookie."
msgstr "先撤销本地会话，再清除 cookie。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`GET`/`POST /v1/waitlist`"
msgstr "`GET`/`POST /v1/waitlist`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Needs a verified, signed-in account only. Submitting again while pending "
"changes nothing. A rejected or revoked application is submitted again "
"only when its owner asks."
msgstr "只要求账号已验证邮箱并已登录。待审批时再次提交不会改变状态。申请被拒绝或准入被撤销后，只有所有者主动操作才会重新提交。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /v1/admin/accounts`, `PATCH /v1/admin/accounts/{id}`"
msgstr "`GET /v1/admin/accounts`, `PATCH /v1/admin/accounts/{id}`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"`approve`, `reject`, `revoke`, `suspend`, `restore`, `grant_admin`, "
"`revoke_admin`, at `expected_version`."
msgstr ""
"按 `expected_version` 执行 "
"`approve`、`reject`、`revoke`、`suspend`、`restore`、`grant_admin` 或 "
"`revoke_admin`。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:88
msgid ""
"Mail links point at the web app's `/verify-email#token=…` and `/reset-"
"password#token=…`. A browser never sends the fragment to a server, so the"
" token stays out of access logs. The page sends the token in an explicit "
"POST, and following a link changes nothing by itself."
msgstr ""
"邮件链接指向 Web 应用的 `/verify-email#token=…` 和 `/reset-password#token=…`。浏览器不会把"
" URL 片段发送给服务器，因此令牌不会进入访问日志。页面通过显式 POST 请求发送令牌，仅打开链接不会改变任何状态。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:93
msgid ""
"Each unsafe `/v1/auth/*` request is checked by the cross-site write "
"guard, whether or not it carries a cookie, and the body must be JSON. A "
"cross-site sign-in would otherwise put an attacker's account in the "
"victim's browser."
msgstr ""
"所有会改变状态的 `/v1/auth/*` 请求，无论是否携带 cookie，都要经过跨站写入保护检查，且请求体必须是 "
"JSON。否则，跨站登录可能把攻击者的账号登录到受害者的浏览器中。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:99
msgid ""
"An account is who signs in. Its admission is whether that person may use "
"Agent. These are separate records:"
msgstr "账号说明登录者是谁，准入决定此人能否使用 Agent。两者分别记录："

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Account and admission"
msgstr "账号与准入状态"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Signs in, reads the application"
msgstr "登录并查看申请"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Owner routes, tasks, terminals, MCP"
msgstr "所有者路由、任务、终端、MCP"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Email unverified"
msgstr "邮箱未验证"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verification and recovery only"
msgstr "仅验证与账号恢复流程"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verified, not applied or pending"
msgstr "已验证，未申请或待审批"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verified, approved"
msgstr "已验证，已获批"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Yes, with ownership checks"
msgstr "是，仍检查所有权"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verified, rejected or revoked"
msgstr "已验证，申请被拒绝或准入被撤销"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Yes, with the reason"
msgstr "是，并显示原因"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Approved and marked administrator"
msgstr "已获批且标记为管理员"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Suspended"
msgstr "账号已停用"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "No; every session is revoked"
msgstr "否；所有会话均被撤销"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:111
msgid ""
"`agent.use` needs a verified, active, approved account. `agent.admin` "
"also needs the explicit administrator flag; the flag alone grants "
"nothing. Granting administration never approves an account. Suspension "
"revokes the account's sessions, clears the administrator flag and turns "
"an approval into a revocation. Restoring an account lets it sign in and "
"apply again, and grants nothing back. An administrator cannot suspend "
"themself or remove their own access; the `ADMIN_TOKEN` can."
msgstr ""
"`agent.use` 要求账号已验证邮箱、处于有效状态且已获批。`agent.admin` "
"还要求显式管理员标记；只有这个标记并不授予任何权限。授予管理权限不会自动批准账号。停用账号会撤销其会话、清除管理员标记，并将已批准的准入改为撤销。恢复账号后可以重新登录和申请，但不会恢复任何权限。管理员不能停用自己或移除自己的准入权限；`ADMIN_TOKEN`"
" 可以执行这些操作。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:119
msgid ""
"Every account or admission change increments the account's `version`, "
"which is `WaitlistEntry.version`. An administrator action names the "
"version it read and is refused with 409 `version_conflict` when the "
"account has changed since. The change and its `agent_admin_audit_log` row"
" commit in one transaction. The audit row records the states, the version"
" and whether a reason was given; it never records an email address, "
"password, hash or token. The acting administrator's own permission is "
"checked again inside that transaction, so an administrator who is "
"suspended while a request is in flight changes nothing "
"(`actor_not_admin`)."
msgstr ""
"每次账号或准入变化都会递增账号的 `version`，也就是 "
"`WaitlistEntry.version`。管理员操作需要指明读取时的版本；如果账号此后已变更，则返回 409 "
"`version_conflict`。变更与对应的 `agent_admin_audit_log` "
"记录在同一事务中提交。审计记录保存状态、版本以及是否填写原因，不记录邮箱、密码、哈希或令牌。该事务内还会再次检查操作者本人的管理权限，所以请求执行期间若管理员被停用，该请求不会更改任何数据，并返回"
" `actor_not_admin`。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:129
msgid "Sessions and credentials"
msgstr "会话与凭据"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:131
msgid ""
"Passwords use HybridInference's Argon2id parameters and rules (see "
"[Reused code](#reused-code)). Hashing runs on a pool of four threads; at "
"most 64 hashes may wait, and beyond that a request is refused with 503 "
"instead of being queued."
msgstr ""
"密码使用 HybridInference 的 Argon2id 参数与规则，见[复用代码](#reused-"
"code)。哈希计算使用四个线程的线程池，最多允许 64 次哈希计算排队；超出时请求返回 503，不再入队。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:135
msgid ""
"A session value is `cals1.` followed by 256 random bits. The database "
"keeps only an HMAC of it, keyed from `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`. A "
"Gateway-mode cookie or JWT is never read in local mode."
msgstr ""
"会话值由 `cals1.` 前缀和 256 个随机位组成。数据库只保存以 `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET` 为密钥计算的 "
"HMAC。本地模式不读取网关模式的 cookie 或 JWT。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:138
msgid ""
"A session lasts 30 days and is never extended. Sign-out, a password reset"
" and a suspension revoke it."
msgstr "会话有效期为 30 天，不会续期。退出登录、重置密码或停用账号都会撤销会话。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:140
msgid ""
"Opening a session takes a lock on the account row before it reads the "
"password, so a session cannot be opened with a password that a concurrent"
" reset has replaced, or for an account that a concurrent suspension has "
"suspended."
msgstr "创建会话时，先锁定账号行，再读取密码。因此，并发重置已经替换的旧密码无法用于创建会话，并发停用的账号也无法创建会话。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:144
msgid ""
"Abuse limits are fixed-window counters in Postgres, so every worker and "
"replica shares them. Their keys are keyed hashes. Sign-in allows 5 "
"attempts per email and address and 50 per email in 15 minutes, and 20 per"
" address in an hour. Sign-up allows 5 per address in an hour and 10 in a "
"day. Mail allows 3 per email in an hour, 10 per email in a day and 10 per"
" address in an hour. Token redemption allows 30 per address in 15 "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"防滥用限制使用 Postgres 中的固定窗口计数器，所有 worker 和副本共享同一组计数，计数器键使用带密钥的哈希。登录限制为：每 15 "
"分钟每个邮箱与地址组合最多 5 次、每个邮箱最多 50 次，每小时每个地址最多 20 次。注册限制为每个地址每小时 5 次、每天 10 "
"次。邮件限制为每个邮箱每小时 3 次、每天 10 次，每个地址每小时 10 次。令牌兑换限制为每个地址每 15 分钟 30 次。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:150
msgid "Neither a recipient address nor a link is written to a log."
msgstr "日志既不记录收件地址，也不记录链接。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:152
msgid "Stopping an account's work"
msgstr "停止账号的工作"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:154
msgid ""
"Revoking or suspending an account commits the change and opens a "
"termination record (`agent_local_access_terminations`) for the new "
"version in the same transaction. From that commit on, every new owner "
"request, claim, goal round and waiting message reads the denial. "
"Residency establishment and residency heartbeats carry the same condition"
" in their own SQL, so an attempt admitted before the revocation cannot "
"establish or extend a residency afterwards."
msgstr ""
"撤销准入或停用账号时，在同一事务中提交变更，并为新版本创建终止记录（`agent_local_access_terminations`）。从提交完成起，所有新的所有者请求、认领、目标轮次和等待消息都会读取到拒绝决定。residency"
" 建立和心跳也在各自的 SQL 中检查同一条件，因此撤权前已获准的 attempt 不能在撤权后建立或延长 residency。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:162
msgid ""
"`terminate_owner_access` (`application/owner_termination.py`) then stops "
"the work already running, using the paths that already end work safely. "
"It cancels queued turns, asks running turns to stop, pauses waiting "
"messages and active goals, cancels environment tests and prebuilds, stops"
" environment actions, and releases every residency. It closes the "
"released member processes. In each sandbox group whose members all belong"
" to the account, it freezes the group's terminals, kills them and lifts "
"the freeze. Groups shared with another owner's chat are never touched. A "
"terminal that a request admitted before the revocation opens afterwards "
"is killed by that request itself, after it has reopened the termination "
"record, so the next pass kills the terminal if that request cannot."
msgstr "随后，`terminate_owner_access`（`application/owner_termination.py`）使用现有的安全结束流程停止已经运行的工作：取消排队轮次，请求运行中的轮次停止，暂停等待消息和活动目标，取消环境测试与预构建，停止环境操作，并释放所有 residency。已释放成员的进程也会被关闭。对于成员全部属于该账号的沙箱组，先冻结该组终端，再终止终端，最后解除冻结。与其他所有者的对话共享的组不会被操作。若撤权前获准的请求在撤权后才打开终端，该请求会先重新开启终止记录，再自行终止新开的终端。这样，即使该请求未能终止终端，下一轮清理也会继续处理。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:174
msgid ""
"The record stays open until a pass finds the terminal cleanup "
"acknowledged and none of the account's turns running. Each reopen "
"increments the record's revision. A pass reads the revision before it "
"starts and closes the record only at that revision, so a terminal "
"reopened while a pass is running keeps the record open for the next pass."
" The background pass checks open records every 30 seconds, up to 50 "
"accounts per pass. A per-account advisory lock serializes passes across "
"processes. Approving the account or granting it administration needs that"
" same lock and no open record, at any revision (otherwise 409 "
"`access_cleanup_pending`), so a delayed pass never stops work that a "
"newer approval allows. Restoring access replays nothing: cancelled turns "
"stay cancelled, and paused goals and queues wait for their owner."
msgstr "只有一轮清理确认终端清理已完成，且该账号没有运行中的轮次，终止记录才会关闭。每次重新开启记录都会递增其修订号。清理开始前先读取修订号，只有记录仍处于该修订号时才能关闭。因此，如果清理期间又有终端被打开，记录便保持开启，交由下一轮清理。后台每 30 秒检查未关闭的记录，每轮最多处理 50 个账号。每个账号使用咨询锁，让不同进程的清理轮次串行执行。批准账号或授予管理权限也必须取得同一把锁，且该账号在任何修订号下都不能有未关闭的终止记录，否则返回 409 `access_cleanup_pending`。因此，延迟执行的清理不会停止后来获批的新工作。恢复准入不会重放任何工作：已取消的轮次保持取消，暂停的目标和队列等待所有者操作。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:187
msgid ""
"No step has a fixed wall-clock deadline. A host that keeps failing, or a "
"backlog of more than one batch of accounts, delays completion. What is "
"fixed is when each kind of work is refused or checked, and that the "
"record stays open, blocking re-approval, until every step is "
"acknowledged."
msgstr "各步骤都没有固定的实际完成时限。主机持续失败，或待处理账号超过一批，都会延迟完成。固定的是各类工作被拒绝或接受检查的时机，以及在所有步骤确认完成之前，终止记录始终保持开启并阻止重新批准。"

