"的请求体、不含敏感信息的 422 响应、本地模式拒绝网关会话，以及仅网关支持的视图。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:244
msgid "The real-Postgres tier (`make test-db-local`) covers local accounts in six files: `tests/integration/storage/test_local_account_store.py` (races, replay, versions, the reset and suspension barriers, shared counters and the namespace), `tests/integration/servers/test_local_access_termination.py` (stopping work, the residency fence, cleanup barriers and delayed passes), `tests/integration/servers/test_local_accounts_flow.py` (the whole flow over HTTP), `tests/integration/storage/test_independent_accounts_acceptance.py` (the public account lifecycle through the real application with Gateway HTTP forbidden), `tests/integration/storage/test_local_session_reset_race.py` (a login waiting on a password reset cannot open a session with the old password), and `tests/integration/storage/test_local_cleanup_lock_acceptance.py` (cancelling a cleanup lock acquisition before its result arrives releases the lock)."
msgstr "使用真实 Postgres 的测试层（`make test-db-local`）通过六个文件覆盖本地账号：`tests/integration/storage/test_local_account_store.py` 覆盖竞态、重放、版本、重置和停用屏障、共享计数器及命名空间；`tests/integration/servers/test_local_access_termination.py` 覆盖停止工作、residency 栅栏、清理屏障和延迟清理轮次；`tests/integration/servers/test_local_accounts_flow.py` 覆盖完整 HTTP 流程；`tests/integration/storage/test_independent_accounts_acceptance.py` 在禁止网关 HTTP 请求的条件下，使用真实应用覆盖公开账号流程；`tests/integration/storage/test_local_session_reset_race.py` 验证等待密码重置完成的登录请求不能用旧密码创建会话；`tests/integration/storage/test_local_cleanup_lock_acceptance.py` 验证申请清理锁的结果尚未返回时取消操作，仍会释放该锁。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:252
msgid "Reused code"
msgstr "复用代码"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:254
msgid ""
"The password hashing and policy, the sign-up, sign-in, verification and "
"recovery behaviour, the mail templates and the abuse limits are adapted "
"from HybridInference (`HarvardMadSys/hybridInference` at "
"`321e9a6c457dcc80d35977aaac472d54041204a8`, MIT License, Copyright (c) "
"2026 Harvard SEAS: the same license and holder as this repository). Each "
"adapted module names its source file. Nothing imports `serving.*`, and "
"nothing shares HybridInference's database, sessions, secrets or tokens. "
"The deliberate differences: a pending account can sign in, a sign-up with"
" a registered address changes nothing, the abuse counters are persisted "
"rather than kept per process, tokens travel in URL fragments, and "
"`argon2-cffi` is called directly rather than through `passlib`."
msgstr ""
"密码哈希与策略、注册、登录、验证和账号恢复行为、邮件模板及防滥用限制均改编自 "
"HybridInference（`HarvardMadSys/hybridInference` 的 "
"`321e9a6c457dcc80d35977aaac472d54041204a8`，MIT License，Copyright (c) 2026"
" Harvard SEAS，与本仓库的许可证和版权持有者相同）。每个改编模块都注明来源文件。没有模块导入 `serving.*`，也不共享 "
"HybridInference "
"的数据库、会话、密钥或令牌。明确保留的差异是：待审批账号可以登录，使用已注册地址注册不会改变账号状态，防滥用计数器持久化保存而非各进程分别保存，令牌通过"
" URL 片段传递，并直接调用 `argon2-cffi`，不经过 `passlib`。"
